flowchart LR
    H["1. Hypothesis<br/>Steady state y(t) in R"]
    E["2. Controlled fault phi<br/>FIS / game day"]
    M["3. Measure SLIs<br/>vs control baseline"]
    A["4. Abort if SLO burn<br/>CloudWatch alarm"]
    L["5. Learn<br/>Fix system or refine model"]

    H --> E
    E --> M
    M --> A
    A -->|within bounds| L
    A -->|violation| R["Rollback phi<br/>Capture telemetry"]
    R --> L

    style H fill:#e8f4fc,stroke:#3498db,stroke-width:2px
    style E fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#f39c12,stroke-width:2px
    style M fill:#e8f4fc,stroke:#3498db
    style A fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,stroke-width:2px
    style L fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px
    style R fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450
